[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21484.67, "timestamp": "05:58:04", "text": "远非快乐，是的，这是快乐的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21486.677, "timestamp": "05:58:06", "author": "@Boy2Man-1734", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1daIzbC99c0P6u6kGBDibfJrLV-MuZvRI2usaiXscUkJjzE7sYwSsrSOluQzEh-SjvViXQSXyw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"Bro it was just a Prank\" The prank in question:"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21487.11, "timestamp": "05:58:07", "text": "感谢上帝，终于结束了"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21488.674, "timestamp": "05:58:08", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "holy what"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21490.19, "timestamp": "05:58:10", "text": "但她必须做点什么。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21493.214, "timestamp": "05:58:13", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "april was shocked, \"but how, dear i saw yr corpse with bloo-..\" the husband cut her off with a bottle of red liquid, \"chicken blood dear, seeems pretty human if u ask me\""}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21494.11, "timestamp": "05:58:14", "text": "因为那个恶作剧，我丈夫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21499.868, "timestamp": "05:58:19", "text": "太多太多太多太多了，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21503.07, "timestamp": "05:58:23", "text": "但现在，我看到你们的警察浑身是血。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21505.35, "timestamp": "05:58:25", "text": "丈夫用刀割断了一个瓶子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21508.868, "timestamp": "05:58:28", "text": "鸡血亲爱的看起来很像人类，如果"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21509.416, "timestamp": "05:58:29", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "he unties her, while the townsfolk laugh around her"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21510.468, "timestamp": "05:58:30", "text": "你问我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21512.868, "timestamp": "05:58:32", "text": "为什么要这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21516.628, "timestamp": "05:58:36", "text": "见鬼，为什么？见鬼，为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21519.868, "timestamp": "05:58:39", "text": "你能一边笑一边听吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21522.15, "timestamp": "05:58:42", "text": "开玩笑吧，在正确的世界里谁会……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21523.228, "timestamp": "05:58:43", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yeah it was too much"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21530.021, "timestamp": "05:58:50", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"you scum, how could you!\" *april punches him in the gut, with him laughing*"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21530.67, "timestamp": "05:58:50", "text": "[音乐]"}]